WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.944 --> 00:00:03.862
NATASHA ROMANOFF
You don't know everything about me.

00:00:03.873 --> 00:00:05.998
The Avengers weren't my first family.

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:08.233
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
It's important for us to understand

00:00:08.238 --> 00:00:14.031
how this family has
shaped the person that Natasha became.

00:00:14.045 --> 00:00:15.420
MELINA VOSTOKOFF
Natasha, don't slouch.

00:00:15.426 --> 00:00:16.426
NATASHA ROMANOFF
I'm not slouching.

00:00:16.442 --> 00:00:17.350
ALEXEI SHOSTAKOV
Listen to your mother.

00:00:17.355 --> 00:00:18.104
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Oh my God. This...

00:00:18.109 --> 00:00:18.776
ALEXEI SHOSTAKOV
Op, op...

00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:20.318
NATASHA ROMANOFF
Alright, enough, all of you.

00:00:20.323 --> 00:00:21.656
YELENA BELOVA
I didn't say anything.

00:00:21.672 --> 00:00:23.755
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
Yelena is the, kind of,

00:00:23.775 --> 00:00:25.212
"little sister" character.

00:00:25.236 --> 00:00:27.268
FLORENCE PUGH
She's there to get the job done.

00:00:27.273 --> 00:00:31.633
Her relationship with Natasha then becomes
quite interesting because they're

00:00:31.638 --> 00:00:34.555
constantly butting heads in
the way that siblings do.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.450
YELENA BELOVA
Why do you always do that thing?

00:00:36.455 --> 00:00:37.180
NATASHA ROMANOFF
What thing?

00:00:37.185 --> 00:00:39.561
YELENA BELOVA
The pose! It's a fighting pose.

00:00:39.574 --> 00:00:41.208
You're a total poser.

00:00:41.233 --> 00:00:43.305
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
It's really fun to be able to see those

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:45.643
two characters
when they're together.

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:47.251
YELENA BELOVA
Such a poser.

00:00:48.826 --> 00:00:50.535
NATASHA ROMANOFF
It's good to see you too, sis.

00:00:51.238 --> 00:00:52.861
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
It was so wonderful to be able to do this

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.239
with Florence because
she's such a wonderful actor.

00:00:55.264 --> 00:00:58.076
Feisty and fiery,
and just full of life.

00:00:58.101 --> 00:01:00.309
FLORENCE PUGH
Scarlett's been the leading female face

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:05.940
of these films for 10 years.
That's definitely a cool badge to wear.

00:01:05.945 --> 00:01:08.392
I remember her daughter
came to set one day and I was like,

00:01:08.397 --> 00:01:12.148
"What does she think you do?" and she goes
"Oh you know, fight baddies for a living."

00:01:12.159 --> 00:01:14.159
And I was like,
"But that is what you do!"

00:01:19.404 --> 00:01:20.238
NATASHA ROMANOFF
I like your vest.

00:01:20.254 --> 00:01:22.193
YELENA BELOVA
God, I knew it. I knew you did.

00:01:22.198 --> 00:01:23.657
It's so cool, right?

